+# Cactus PoC – Client-side Obfuscation with eBPF
+
+This repository contains a minimal, runnable proof-of-concept for client-side
+obfuscation (Cactus-style) and a small C³ demo harness for website-fingerprinting
+experiments. See test_harness.sh and demo.sh for runnable examples.
+
+Requirements and usage are in the repo — run `chmod +x *.sh` and follow the
+scripts. BPF functionality requires root privileges and the `python3-bcc` system
+package on Debian/Ubuntu.
+
